  "memorableMoments": [
    "On the first day, I got a double laceration but managed to sleep on the floor of a brick factory. It was tense, but I survived. There is a surviver house nearby with loads of books and recipes. Will loot soon.",
    "On the second day, a gimp I was standing on managed to bite my leg. I had to enter god mode for a moment to solve the issue. I had spent the entire day looking for a hammer, and managed to pick up a full bed in one go. Yay for good sleep with a pillow!",
    "I've managed to build up the beginnings of a good base. I am confident that I can survive this for at least a month.",
    "I got a Rampage Medal from the Summary mod. Killed half a neighborhood, but managed to clear access to the school and the food market.",
    "I have managed to build the beginnings of a good base. Lots of storage, but i still need to put up walls. I need clay for that. Kitchen is mostly installed, as is the bed, and a reading nook."
